  "id": "civil-rights",
  "term": "civil rights",
  "definition": "Civil rights are legal protections that support a person’s equal access, inclusion, and fair treatment in society. In this context, they refer to protections against discrimination, stigma, and being denied access or services because of disability or use of a service dog.",
