      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not provide a definition of “civil rights” as “legal protections that support a person’s equal access, inclusion, and fair treatment in society,” or any equivalent general definition.",
        "The packet supports that service dog partners report “stigma, discrimination, and access or service denials” and that these occur “despite legal protections,” but it does not explicitly frame these as the definition of “civil rights.”",
        "The definition’s specific phrasing about “protections against discrimination, stigma, and being denied access or services because of disability or use of a service dog” is only partially supported: the packet mentions stigma/discrimination/access denials and discusses service dog partners with disabilities, but it does not explicitly define civil rights in those exact terms."
